{"id":"5b3136294b848078cf39f528","slug":"helen-frankenthaler-geisha-16","title":"Geisha","artists":["Helen Frankenthaler"],"date":"2003","medium":"Ukiyo-e style woodcut on Torinoko paper","dimensions":"38 × 26 in","image":"s3cyon88YnL5FWhP-kOU9w","c":["#999098","#c2c3be","#a89e71"],"said":[{"k":"note","q":"Frankenthaler spent years perfecting Geisha, a 23-color Ukiyo-e woodcut inspired by Japanese landscapes and the traditional themes of geisha and kabuki. Her complicated woodcuts, especially those using the Ukiyo-e style, like those from the Genji series, are highly regarded in the artist’s oeuvre.","by":"Long-Sharp Gallery, on Artsy"}],"events":[{"k":"made","y":"2003","q":"2003","o":1,"s":[0]},{"k":"listed","y":"2018-06-25","who":"Long-Sharp Gallery","n":"listed by the gallery","o":5,"s":[0]},{"k":"owned","who":"Pace Prints","q":"Pace Prints","o":1,"s":[1],"x":[0]},{"k":"exhibited","y":"2019-06-07","e":"2019-07-20","t":"Modern + Contemporary Prints","v":"Long-Sharp Gallery","ll":[39.7703,-86.1594],"w":"Indianapolis, US","p":"indianapolis-us","pr":"venue","o":2,"s":[0]},{"k":"exhibited","y":"2020-05-13","e":"2020-06-14","t":"Long-Sharp Gallery at IFPDA Fine Art Print Fair Online Spring 2020","v":"Long-Sharp Gallery","n":"at IFPDA Print Fair Online Spring 2020","o":3,"s":[0]},{"k":"exhibited","y":"2021-02-25","e":"2021-07-01","t":"Driven to Abstraction","v":"Long-Sharp Gallery","o":4,"s":[0]}],"sources":[{"name":"Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/helen-frankenthaler-geisha-16"},{"name":"Long-Sharp Gallery, on Artsy","url":"https://www.artsy.net/artwork/helen-frankenthaler-geisha-16"}],"threads":[{"id":"53603b5b","k":"owner","name":"Pace Prints","at":"New York","y":0,"n":1},{"id":"8f410750","k":"artist","name":"Helen Frankenthaler","y":2006,"n":34}],"asof":"2026-10-01"}